o, segurança, praticidade ou entretenimento&lt;br&gt;• Estágio da obra e prazo" style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;size=12;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=6;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="1190" width="470" height="140" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p2-c72" value='&lt;b&gt;Regras desta página&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Na 1ª mensagem o humano é notificado &lt;i&gt;em paralelo&lt;/i&gt; ao início do atendimento pelo agente.&lt;br&gt;• "Lead pede humano" interrompe a qualificação e cai na opção 3 (ponto A).&lt;br&gt;• Lead em dúvida: o agente sinaliza o humano e segue para a personalização ao mesmo tempo. Se o humano decidir assumir ou desqualificar, interrompe o agente.&lt;br&gt;• Opção 3: depois da 2ª notificação o agente não insiste mais; aguarda o humano.&lt;br&gt;• Feriados não são horário comercial (seguem a pág. 3).&lt;br&gt;• Inatividade: ver pág. 4 (15 min ×2, 23h, 24h → perdido).&lt;br&gt;• Do agendamento em diante, a responsabilidade é do &lt;b&gt;Processo Comercial&lt;/b&gt;.' style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;size=12;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=6;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="530" y="1190" width="640" height="170" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p2-c73" value="&lt;b&gt;⚠ Em aberto (horário comercial)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;1. Quem recebe as notificações (Lucas, Daniel, um grupo) e por qual canal (WhatsApp, e-mail, CRM)?" style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;size=12;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=6;fillColor=#f8cecc;strokeColor=#b85450;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1190" y="1190" width="420" height="80" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram><diagram id="p3" name="3. IA Genérico – Fora do horário"><mxGraphModel dx="1400" dy="900" grid="1" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="2450" pageHeight="1350" math="0" shadow="0"><root><mxCell id="0"/><mxCell id="1" parent="0"/><mxCell id="p3-c1" value="&lt;b&gt;Agente IA Genérico · Fora do horário comercial (noites, fins de semana e feriados)&lt;/b&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=18;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="44" width="2320" height="36" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p3-lane-lead" value="Lead" style="swimlane;horizontal=0;html=1;startSize=36;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#666666;swimlaneFillColor=#ffffff;fontStyle=1;fontSize=13;collapsible=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="90" width="2320" height="170" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p3-lane-agente" value="Agente IA Genérico" style="swimlane;horizontal=0;html=1;startSize=36;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;swimlaneFillColor=#ffffff;fontStyle=1;fontSize=13;collapsible=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="260" width="2320" height="430" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p3-lane-crm" value="CRM / Funis" style="swimlane;horizontal=0;html=1;startSize=36;fillColor=#ffe6cc;strokeColor=#d79b00;swimlaneFillColor=#ffffff;fontStyle=1;fontSize=13;collapsible=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="690" width="2320" height="140" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p3-lane-humano" value="Atendente humano" style="swimlane;horizontal=0;html=1;startSize=36;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;swimlaneFillColor=#ffffff;fontStyle=1;fontSize=13;collapsible=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="830" width="2320" height="360" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p3-c2" value="Lead envia a 1ª mensagem&lt;br&gt;(qualquer canal)" style="points=[[0.145,0.145,0],[0.5,0,0],[0.855,0.145,0],[1,0.5,0],[0.855,0.855,0],[0.5,1,0],[0.145,0.855,0],[0,0.5,0]];shape=mxgraph.bpmn.event;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;labelBackgroundColor=none;perimeter=ellipsePerimeter;outlineConnect=0;aspect=fixed;outline=standard;symbol=message;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeWidth=1;labelPosition=right;verticalLabelPosition=middle;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=4;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="p3-lane-lead"><mxGeometry x="185" y="60" width="50" height="50" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p3-c3" value="Fora do horário (inclusive feriados) só o agente atende: &lt;b&gt;não&lt;/b&gt; há notificação ao humano na 1ª mensagem." style="html=1;shape=mxgraph.flowchart.annotation_1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;pointerEvents=1;whiteSpace=wrap;spacingLeft=6;fontSize=10;fontColor=#333333;" vertex="1" parent="p3-lane-lead"><mxGeometry x="430" y="20" width="360" height="50" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p3-c4" value="O lead pode pedir um humano a qualquer momento. Ele é avisado do horário (seg–sex, 9h–18h) e pode deixar o pedido na fila." style="html=1;shape=mxgraph.flowchart.annotation_1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;pointerEvents=1;whiteSpace=wrap;spacingLeft=6;fontSize=10;fontColor=#333333;" vertex="1" parent="p3-lane-lead"><mxGeometry x="830" y="20" width="380" height="50" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p3-c5" value="Responder dúvidas do lead e fazer a qualificação" style="points=[[0.25,0,0],[0.5,0,0],[0.75,0,0],[1,0.25,0],[1,0.5,0],[1,0.75,0],[0.75,1,0],[0.5,1,0],[0.25,1,0],[0,0.75,0],[0,0.5,0],[0,0.25,0]];shape=mxgraph.bpmn.task2;whiteSpace=wrap;rectStyle=rounded;size=10;html=1;expand=0;collapsible=0;taskMarker=service;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="p3-lane-agente"><mxGeometry x="100" y="60" width="220" height="90" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p3-c6" value="Inatividade" style="points=[[0.145,0.145,0],[0.5,0,0],[0.855,0.145,0],[1,0.5,0],[0.855,0.855,0],[0.5,1,0],[0.145,0.855,0],[0,0.5,0]];shape=mxgraph.bpmn.event;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;labelBackgroundColor=none;perimeter=ellipsePerimeter;outlineConnect=0;aspect=fixed;outline=boundNonint;symbol=timer;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeWidth=1;labelPosition=left;verticalLabelPosition=middle;align=right;verticalAlign=middle;spacingRight=4;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="p3-lane-agente"><mxGeometry x="130" y="130" width="40" height="40" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p3-c7" value="Lead pede&lt;br&gt;humano" style="points=[[0.145,0.145,0],[0.5,0,0],[0.855,0.145,0],[1,0.5,0],[0.855,0.855,0],[0.5,1,0],[0.145,0.855,0],[0,0.5,0]];shape=mxgraph.bpmn.event;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;labelBackgroundColor=none;perimeter=ellipsePerimeter;outlineConnect=0;aspect=fixed;outline=boundNonint;symbol=message;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeWidth=1;labelPosition=right;verticalLabelPosition=middle;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=4;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="p3-lane-agente"><mxGeometry x="260" y="130" width="40" height="40" as="geometry"/></mxCell><UserObject id="p3-c8" label="Regras de inatividade&lt;br&gt;&lt;i&gt;(pág. 4)&lt;/i&gt;" link="data:page/id,p4"><mxCell style="points=[[0.25,0,0],[0.5,0,0],[0.75,0,0],[1,0.25,0],[1,0.5,0],[1,0.75,0],[0.75,1,0],[0.5,1,0],[0.25,1,0],[0,0.75,0],[0,0.5,0],[0,0.25,0]];shape=mxgraph.bpmn.task2;whiteSpace=wrap;rectStyle=rounded;size=10;html=1;expand=0;collapsible=0;bpmnShapeType=call;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="p3-lane-agente"><mxGeometry x="65" y="250" width="170" height="70" as="geometry"/></mxCell></UserObject><mxCell id="p3-c9" value="Informar o horário humano (seg–sex, 9h–18h) e oferecer: deixar pedido para o humano ou seguir com o agente" style="points=[[0.25,0,0],[0.5,0,0],[0.75,0,0],[1,0.25,0],[1,0.5,0],[1,0.75,0],[0.75,1,0],[0.5,1,0],[0.25,1,0],[0,0.75,0],[0,0.5,0],[0,0.25,0]];shape=mxgraph.bpmn.task2;whiteSpace=wrap;rectStyle=rounded;size=10;html=1;expand=0;collapsible=0;taskMarker=send;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="p3-lane-agente"><mxGeometry x="250" y="240" width="200" height="90" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p3-c10" value="Lead&lt;br&gt;prefere" style="points=[[0.25,0.25,0],[0.5,0,0],[0.75,0.25,0],[1,0.5,0],[0.75,0.75,0],[0.5,1,0],[0.25,0.75,0],[0,0.5,0]];shape=mxgraph.bpmn.gateway2;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;labelBackgroundColor=none;perimeter=rhombusPerimeter;outlineConnect=0;outline=none;symbol=exclusiveGw;verticalLabelPosition=top;verticalAlign=bottom;align=center;fontSize=11;fillColor=#ffffff;" vertex="1" parent="p3-lane-agente"><mxGeometry x="490" y="260" width="50" height="50" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p3-c11" value="Conversa segue&lt;br&gt;com o agente" style="points=[[0.145,0.145,0],[0.5,0,0],[0.855,0.145,0],[1,0.5,0],[0.855,0.855,0],[0.5,1,0],[0.145,0.855,0],[0,0.5,0]];shape=mxgraph.bpmn.event;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;labelBackgroundColor=none;perimeter=ellipsePerimeter;outlineConnect=0;aspect=fixed;outline=end;symbol=general;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeWidth=1;labelPosition=right;verticalLabelPosition=middle;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=4;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="p3-lane-agente"><mxGeometry x="500" y="360" width="30" height="30" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p3-c12" value="Vai para &lt;b&gt;B&lt;/b&gt;" style="points=[[0.145,0.145,0],[0.5,0,0],[0.855,0.145,0],[1,0.5,0],[0.855,0.855,0],[0.5,1,0],[0.145,0.855,0],[0,0.5,0]];shape=mxgraph.bpmn.event;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;labelBackgroundColor=none;perimeter=ellipsePerimeter;outlineConnect=0;aspect=fixed;outline=throwing;symbol=link;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeWidth=1;verticalLabelPosition=top;verticalAlign=bottom;align=center;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="p3-lane-agente"><mxGeometry x="600" y="265" width="40" height="40" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p3-c13" value="Lead&lt;br&gt;qualificado?" style="points=[[0.25,0.25,0],[0.5,0,0],[0.75,0.25,0],[1,0.5,0],[0.75,0.75,0],[0.5,1,0],[0.25,0.75,0],[0,0.5,0]];shape=mxgraph.bpmn.gateway2;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;labelBackgroundColor=none;perimeter=rhombusPerimeter;outlineConnect=0;outline=none;symbol=exclusiveGw;verticalLabelPosition=top;verticalAlign=bottom;align=center;fontSize=11;fillColor=#ffffff;" vertex="1" parent="p3-lane-agente"><mxGeometry x="700" y="80" width="50" height="50" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p3-c14" value="Sinalizar o lead para avaliação humana no próximo dia útil &lt;i&gt;(o agente segue a conversa)&lt;/i&gt;" style="points=[[0.25,0,0],[0.5,0,0],[0.75,0,0],[1,0.25,0],[1,0.5,0],[1,0.75,0],[0.75,1,0],[0.5,1,0],[0.25,1,0],[0,0.75,0],[0,0.5,0],[0,0.25,0]];shape=mxgraph.bpmn.task2;whiteSpace=wrap;rectStyle=rounded;size=10;html=1;expand=0;collapsible=0;taskMarker=send;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="p3-lane-agente"><mxGeometry x="650" y="245" width="150" height="90" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p3-c15" value="Personalizar a proposta e oferecer as 3 opções" style="points=[[0.25,0,0],[0.5,0,0],[0.75,0,0],[1,0.25,0],[1,0.5,0],[1,0.75,0],[0.75,1,0],[0.5,1,0],[0.25,1,0],[0,0.75,0],[0,0.5,0],[0,0.25,0]];shape=mxgraph.bpmn.task2;whiteSpace=wrap;rectStyle=rounded;size=10;html=1;expand=0;collapsible=0;taskMarker=service;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="p3-lane-agente"><mxGeometry x="810" y="65" width="180" height="80" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p3-c16" value="Opção&lt;br&gt;escolhida" style="points=[[0.25,0.25,0],[0.5,0,0],[0.75,0.25,0],[1,0.5,0],[0.75,0.75,0],[0.5,1,0],[0.25,0.75,0],[0,0.5,0]];shape=mxgraph.bpmn.gateway2;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;labelBackgroundColor=none;perimeter=rhombusPerimeter;outlineConnect=0;outline=none;symbol=exclusiveGw;verticalLabelPosition=top;verticalAlign=bottom;align=center;fontSize=11;fillColor=#ffffff;" vertex="1" parent="p3-lane-agente"><mxGeometry x="1060" y="80" width="50" height="50" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p3-c17" value="1) Agendar visita ao showroom" style="points=[[0.25,0,0],[0.5,0,0],[0.75,0,0],[1,0.25,0],[1,0.5,0],[1,0.75,0],[0.75,1,0],[0.5,1,0],[0.25,1,0],[0,0.75,0],[0,0.5,0],[0,0.25,0]];shape=mxgraph.bpmn.task2;whiteSpace=wrap;rectStyle=rounded;size=10;html=1;expand=0;collapsible=0;taskMarker=service;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="p3-lane-agente"><mxGeometry x="1190" y="10" width="180" height="60" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p3-c18" value="2) Agendar ligação com a equipe de vendas" style="points=[[0.25,0,0],[0.5,0,0],[0.75,0,0],[1,0.25,0],[1,0.5,0],[1,0.75,0],[0.75,1,0],[0.5,1,0],[0.25,1,0],[0,0.75,0],[0,0.5,0],[0,0.25,0]];shape=mxgraph.bpmn.task2;whiteSpace=wrap;rectStyle=rounded;size=10;html=1;expand=0;collapsible=0;taskMarker=service;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="p3-lane-agente"><mxGeometry x="1190" y="75" width="180" height="60" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p3-c19" value="3) Avisar o horário humano (seg–sex, 9h–18h) e registrar o pedido na fila" style="points=[[0.25,0,0],[0.5,0,0],[0.75,0,0],[1,0.25,0],[1,0.5,0],[1,0.75,0],[0.75,1,0],[0.5,1,0],[0.25,1,0],[0,0.75,0],[0,0.5,0],[0,0.25,0]];shape=mxgraph.bpmn.task2;whiteSpace=wrap;rectStyle=rounded;size=10;html=1;expand=0;collapsible=0;taskMarker=send;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="p3-lane-agente"><mxGeometry x="1190" y="165" width="180" height="80" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p3-c20" value="&lt;b&gt;B&lt;/b&gt;" style="points=[[0.145,0.145,0],[0.5,0,0],[0.855,0.145,0],[1,0.5,0],[0.855,0.855,0],[0.5,1,0],[0.145,0.855,0],[0,0.5,0]];shape=mxgraph.bpmn.event;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;labelBackgroundColor=none;perimeter=ellipsePerimeter;outlineConnect=0;aspect=fixed;outline=catching;symbol=link;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeWidth=1;labelPosition=left;verticalLabelPosition=middle;align=right;verticalAlign=middle;spacingRight=4;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="p3-lane-agente"><mxGeometry x="1260" y="300" width="40" height="40" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p3-c21" value="Processo&lt;br&gt;Comercial" style="points=[[0.145,0.145,0],[0.5,0,0],[0.855,0.145,0],[1,0.5,0],[0.855,0.855,0],[0.5,1,0],[0.145,0.855,0],[0,0.5,0]];shape=mxgraph.bpmn.event;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;labelBackgroundColor=none;perimeter=ellipsePerimeter;outlineConnect=0;aspect=fixed;outline=end;symbol=general;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeWidth=1;labelPosition=righ